67-wei67:p002","quote":"光弟敬友，本州治中。頗有受納，御史案之，乃與守者俱逃。後除梁郡太守，會遭所生母憂，不拜。敬友精心佛道，晝夜誦經。免喪之後，遂菜食終世。恭寬接下，修身厲節。自景明已降，頻歲不登，飢寒請丐者，皆取足而去。又置逆旅於肅然山南大路之北，設食以供行者。延昌三年二月卒，年五十九。\n子鴻，字彥鸞。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-067-wei67:p002:m0136","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-067-wei67:p002:m0002","source_term":"子鴻","source_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-067-wei67-hong-father-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"鴻誌明記第四弟鵾；《魏書》記鴻為敬友子，依兩筆原證暫接父系。 來源並未逐子重述父名。","comparative_source_path":"source-evidence/cui-jingyou-family/epitaph-comparison.json"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-beishi-044-bei44-ws2183262","work_id":"w-beishi","book_id":"b-beishi-044","chapter_id":"c-beishi-044-bei44","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-beishi-044-bei44:p004:m0019"],"paragraph_ids":["c-beishi-044-bei44:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-beishi-044-bei44:p004:m0019","mention_ids":["c-beishi-044-bei44:p004:m0019"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts-rubbing","work_id":"w-epitaph-cuihong","book_id":"b-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0018"],"paragraph_ids":["c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0018","mention_ids":["c-epitaph-cuihong-excerpts:p002:m0018"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位